  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. go to a nice dark world to fall asleep\n\n3. controllers fall asleep\n\n4. nice bright instructions for single hand controls\n\nI'm not sure when this changed, but when I first started using vrchat, the hands would default to the side, so when I disconnected my controllers I could look down and see them.\n\nPossible resolutions \n\n1. Ability to hide the pie thing that talks about Single hand controls\n\n2. Put it somewhere else when there is no controller connected\n\n3. Allow this to be dimmed via the Brightness option in VRChat.\n\nI'm using an Oculus Rift CV1 via Oculus store\n\nFirst screenshot shows where in the face it shows up, stuck to the head, and the second screenshot shows what it says",
